<title>GERMANY: Dresdner focusing on U.S. in search for buy.</title>
<headline>Dresdner focusing on U.S. in search for buy.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG said on Tuesday that it was focusing on the U.S. in its search for a possible acquisition in the investment banking sector.</p>
<p>&quot;We want to expand our investment banking position in the U.S.,&quot; Sarrazin told reporters.</p>
<p>He added that Dresdner was not in takeover talks and had not identified a specific target yet.</p>
<p>&quot;We're not in negotiations at present,&quot; Sarrazin said.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
